{"parentUuid":"0c08db7e-fcab-42d5-898c-8432dade64d5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG2YVxQoYufYYomeW6EY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CJoQT2rxHUhxZY4ak291oT","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 - <<'PY'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"    column of earth and roll dust along the ground; tracers and sparks never\"\"\"\nb=\"\"\"    column of earth and roll dust along the ground; a shot or a step into\n    water throws up a spout of spray and spreads a ring flat on it; tracers\n    and sparks never\"\"\"\nassert s.count(a)==1; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nREDACTED; node $S/hl.mjs eval $S/q_chk2.js | tr -d '\\n '; echo; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git add fun/hedgerow/README.md fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: water splashes lie on the water\n\nA splash's ring was a camera-facing sprite like every particle, so seen\nfrom the bank or while wading it stood up over the river like a hoop, and\nits spray was three round white balls. The ring now lies flat on the water\n(an ellipse from a low eye; the particle materials are double-sided so the\nflat quad is not culled) and the spray rises as spouts stretched along\ntheir flight. Bullet hits, grenades and steps into water all use it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && git merge-tree --write-tree hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\"","description":"Commit the water splash fixes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":524,"cache_read_input_tokens":799143,"output_tokens":942,"output_tokens_details":{"thi