{"parentUuid":"606fc280-3bb1-43c1-a825-d52e138ff0b8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG2oLTb7LKSjrp98bvuz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MnozWhp3xgnCTPPQ7k9zJH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 - <<'PY'\np='js/clutter.js'\ns=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(a)==1, (s.count(a), a)\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"\"\"  // a wet stone mirrors the dusk glow less than a puddle would: a softer, weaker sheen\n  const mat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xffffff, roughness: stone ? 0.75 : 0.85, metalness: 0, envMapIntensity: stone ? 0.55 : 1 });\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  const mat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xffffff, roughness: stone ? 0.75 : 0.85, metalness: 0 });\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"        roughnessFactor = mix(roughnessFactor, ${stone ? '0.46' : '0.72'}, uWet);\n        roughnessFactor = mix(roughnessFactor, 0.75, vMud);`);\"\"\", \"\"\"        roughnessFactor = mix(roughnessFactor, ${stone ? '0.38' : '0.72'}, uWet);\n        roughnessFactor = mix(roughnessFactor, 0.75, vMud);`);\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"   ground (from the map's heights), stones sunk to a third of their height,\n   twigs resting on the ground. Stones are a low icosphere pushed about by\n   noise and flattened, from grit to the odd fist-sized one, wet and glossy;\"\"\", \"\"\"   ground (from the map's heights), stones sunk to a third of their height,\n   twigs resting on the ground. Stones are a low icosphere pushed about by\n   noise and flattened, from grit to the odd fist-sized one, wet and glossy,\n   caked dull with the mud where they sit in it;\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode --check js/clutter.js && cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git diff --stat && node fun/hedgerow/tests/clutter-check.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80","descrip