{"parentUuid":"60d6ab19-0deb-4af5-95cf-95e7f51d3af6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG2uRXbhEx7oYW3Ha5wT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added three more commits to `hedgerow-grass` this round. Nothing is pushed, the branch still merges cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`, and the four first-person files (camera, player, hud, character) are untouched.\n\nThis round I reviewed full-size frames across the level (street, square, lane, forest, river, ground, sky) to find what looked weakest or broken:\n\n- **a542d608 – rain shows where it's lit.** Rain streaks were equally visible everywhere, so dark forests and fields were covered in bright white needles as if in daylight. Unlit streaks now show at 45% of their old strength, while rain near lamps, fires and flares glitters as before. Lightning now lights up all the rain for its flash.\n- **c798bd61 – fixed a bug: water splashes stood up like hoops.** Splash rings always turned to face the camera, so seen from the riverbank or while wading they hung upright over the water. They now lie flat on the surface, and the spray rises as a spout instead of round white balls. This applies to bullet hits, grenades and steps into water.\n- **32b946c1 – lane stones caked with mud.** The stones sat on the mud like clean eggs; their lower third now blends into a dull, muddy finish where they meet the ground. It's a subtle change. I also tried weakening their wet shine, but it made no visible difference, so I left that out.\n\nAll three quality presets compile without shader errors and the node checks pass. The test server and headless browser are stopped and my `launch.json` entry is removed. Each commit is logged in the shared notes file, `hedgerow-grass-session.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":236,"cache_read_input_tokens":827803,"output_tokens":528,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":236,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":528,"cache_read_input_tokens":827803,"cache_creation_input_tokens":236,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":236},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"be4bd694-e15e-41ba-b1f1-9df35778001e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgG2uQnSzR89HkU6LN42j","requestRef":"7307f2d5-8661-4012-a39b-45caa4b73347","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"b9760d07-8a52-43cc-99ee-f22dee272c95","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:43:51.161Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
