{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"acc3246d133abc37706ca07858f27ab11ae9263221f70283bdd89db16da34140","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'll add a second always-on shadowed point light (for high quality only) that picks up the second-strongest nearby lamp or fire at least 4 m from the first, following the same fallback and caster-selection logic in main.js as the first light.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011VwLVto7V2GMi5gK358kLU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && sed -n 100,125p js/lights.js","description":"Re-read the shadow light selection block"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
