{"parentUuid":"c213b641-ccc0-49d2-a1fc-315b8fca767d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HLfriW1J2JKEjHXLP4MBXD","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"a3b88391-0862-47c9-b77d-e7ec9d1f0257","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:03:31.371Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","oldString":"Measured: the meadow grass costs","newString":"Tried and dropped: a second shadow-casting lamp (lights.js shadowLight2 for the next-strongest\nlamp/fire, high only). Subtle gain (sandbags shaded from the truck fire), but +10-15 ms a frame\n(street 43 -> 54 ms, square 39 -> 54 ms on the test GPU): every material lights each pixel with one\nmore point light and samples one more cube shadow. Redrawing the cube shadow map itself costs ~0.\nPerf note: per-pixel lighting with the 8-light pool + the shadow light is the main fragment cost;\nthe pool size is the big lever if frame time ever matters (fewer lights lit at once).\n\nMeasured: the meadow grass costs","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":193,"oldLines":6,"newStart":193,"newLines":13,"lines":["   Reviewed this round, fine: aiming down sights (the sight picture is the FP rig's), churchyard,","   bridge (its parapet top is a smooth coping, not a texture bug), bunker, burning halftrack."," ","+Tried and dropped: a second shadow-casting lamp (lights.js shadowLight2 for the next-strongest","+lamp/fire, high only). Subtle gain (sandbags shaded from the truck fire), but +10-15 ms a frame","+(street 43 -> 54 ms, square 39 -> 54 ms on the test GPU): every material lights each pixel with one","+more point light and samples one more cube shadow. Redrawing the cube shadow map itself costs ~0.","+Perf note: per-pixel lighting with the 8-light pool + the shadow light is the main fragment cost;","+the pool size is the big lever if frame time ever matters (fewer lights lit at once).","+"," Measured: the meadow grass costs ~5.8-9.5 ms on this headless GPU at high quality looking across"," the meadow (0.5 ms looking at the sky), and it scales with pixels (fragment-bound: shading the"," visible blades with all the scene's lights). Drawing the tufts near-to-far made no measurable"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2b7f11d8-39fd-41e7-94ad-d5cb0be71b4a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c213b641-ccc0-49d2-a1fc-315b8fca767d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
