{"parentUuid":"a7f9935b-c83b-46d3-8788-17e3d6485ef8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG4SeKGwa2MXLwxMPL7D","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This round I added one commit to `hedgerow-grass` and tried and reverted one experiment. Nothing is pushed, the branch still merges cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`, and the four first-person files (camera, player, hud, character) are untouched.\n\n- **b4c41aa9 – no two muzzle flashes look alike.** Every flash used to be identical, and at an MG42's rate one flash lasts into the next, so a burst sat over the gun as one steady white ball. Each flash now varies in size and brightness, so a burst flickers like real fire, and your own shots look slightly different from one another too.\n- **Tried and reverted: shadows from a second lamp.** Only the strongest lamp or fire near you casts shadows, so I tried letting the next-strongest one cast too. The gain was subtle, such as sandbags picking up a shadow from the burning truck. The cost was 10–15 ms per frame (43 → 54 ms in the street), because every surface then has to light each pixel with one more lamp and check its shadow. Lighting each pixel with the 8 nearby lights is the biggest per-pixel cost in the game, and that's the lever to pull if frame rate ever needs work. It's written up in the shared notes.\n\nI also reviewed views I hadn't checked before: aiming down the sights, the churchyard, the bridge, the bunker and the burning halftrack. Nothing needed fixing. The sight picture when aiming is set by the first-person camera code, which I'm not touching. The bridge railing's plain look is its smooth concrete cap, not a missing texture. The room lamps behind lit windows already flicker gently.\n\nAll three quality presets compile without shader errors. The test server and headless browser are stopped and my `launch.json` entry is removed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":239,"cache_read_input_tokens":942915,"output_tokens":578,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":239,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":942915,"cache_creation_input_tokens":239,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":239},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5cdc5221-9dd2-4860-94ae-6da0b2153cf4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgG4SdTRURY1Z85dou9hd","requestRef":"fb992cca-f3a3-4a3d-9245-f9c0e91f91ae","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b693cfa-4f3e-49dc-bf3c-b9914f98758c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:04:02.786Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
