gin at startup\n  (main.js calls cullPointLights() right after the imports) so a point light with\n  directLight.visible == false skips RE_Direct and its shadow lookup. Same picture; GPU frame\n  ~40-45 ms -> ~15-20 ms on the test machine. NOTE for three.js upgrades: it looks for\n  'getPointLightInfo( pointLight, geometryPosition, directLight );' and the next RE_Direct call;\n  does nothing if absent.\n\nMeasured: the meadow grass costs"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"c63c5e3f-a8f0-418e-941a-87fc922f6305","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgG4q5KYJtJZNQBbjGkQn","requestRef":"5dfd0a4c-7fbf-4e59-ab18-1222114ec3c1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b13d1b3e-3193-4803-bda1-23d8f29998fe","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:09:04.841Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
