{"parentUuid":"1a395935-2ced-4f5a-80b1-a9ce3388063b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JvYNM1Wm7PX78akxCXVAYB","type":"tool_result","content":"196:Tried and dropped: a second shadow-casting lamp (lights.js shadowLight2 for the next-strongest\n203:- 94c82211 PERF (big): lightloop.js patches THREE.ShaderChunk.lights_fragment_begin at startup\n84:- ea7e6904 rain splash crowns dimmed where unlit (weather.js CROWN_FRAG).\n85:- ac6d826e lit windows glowing in the rain (windowlight.js: view ray clipped to the light's\n87:- a82ee71b embers drifting off the fires (effects.js particles gain `ride` (drag towards the wind)\n89:- 71c792c1 smouldering round fires (materials.js `smoulder` variant: 'wood' cracks for ruin/\n91:- b83485ae light through the grass blades (grass.js RE_Direct_Blade, shares FOLIAGE_UNIFORMS).\n92:- 63fde205 specular AA on the terrain (terrain.js, Kaplanyan-style on alpha^2; SPEC_AA; subtle).\n93:- 5856e8e0 rain beaded on the lit windows (rooms.js rmDrops bends the room ray's direction;\n95:- de580ca6 skin that scatters light (materials.js `skin` variant for the allied/axis atlases:\n98:- f3957912 wool that stays wool in the rain (same variant: cloth found by baked roughness/metal;\n100:- 751e9695 no sun glinting on the puddles (fill.js, new: patches three's\n107:- 014b48b6 firelight shafts (shafts.js second pass: equiangular samples of the shadow point light's\n112:- 1a76a524 trees and grass bend in the rain's gusts (weather.js exports GUST_GLSL; materials.js\n115:- 56efa833 FIX + upgrade: bullet holes now show (atmosphere.js decals; main.js passes `shared`).\n122:- d7d61419 FIX: plumes drawn in the chain's first pass (effects.js `pass.scene`, plumes.js drawLate\n128:- 16830290 close-up grain on baked solids (materials.js addWeather `grain`, GRAIN_UNIFORMS,\n134:- 4d7fab84 brass cases (casings.js, new: instanced lathe meshes, physics vs G.world groundAt and\n141:- d2cb29be tracers at range (effects.js VERT: streaks at least 1.5 px wide, uScreen now also in\n145:- 8080ed1e lights.js update(): a flash's fog (volumetric glow) scales from 15% at <= 1.5 m from the\n150:- 00ee1ea8 close-up wool weave / skin grain on soldiers within 3 m (materials.js skin variant:\n153:- 28915b17 FIX: the axis upper sleeves/shoulders (baked roughness 0.5-0.7) were not taken for wool\n158:- 378cd410 eave drips (drips.js, new). NOTE: levelBuild.js now also returns `props` (the\n163:- 808ded9b drip splashes (drips.js SPLASH_VERT + weather.js CROWN_FRAG, now exported): a crown\n166:- 58c4ef5b blast debris as solid lumps (chunks.js, new; combat.js explode() calls G.chunks.burst;\n171:- a542d608 near rain streaks: unlit opacity share uUnlit 0.45 (was effectively 1), lamp/fire/flare\n175:- c798bd61 FIX: water splash rings stood upright like hoops (camera-facing sprites) when seen from\n179:- 32b946c1 clutter stones caked with mud low down (clutter.js vMud from the stone's own height:\n183:- c5cb31f5 muzzle smoke thinner (effects.js muzzle(): '#706f6c' at 0.13, size1 0.65): bursts no longer\n188:- 058c0569 ai.js fire(): the miss's world hit is found before the tracer, which now ends there\n192:- b4c41aa9 muzzle flashes vary per shot (effects.js muzzle(): size 0.65-1.35x, heat 0.6-1.2x).\n203:- 94c82211 PERF (big): lightloop.js patches THREE.ShaderChunk.lights_fragment_begin at startup","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"100dff7c-5e54-4af5-b82d-aad2dbf77062","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:14:33.785Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"196:Tried and dropped: a second shadow-casting lamp (lights.js shadowLight2 for the next-strongest\n203:- 94c82211 PERF (big): lightloop.js patches THREE.ShaderChunk.lights_fragment_begin at startup\n84:- ea7e6904 rain splash crowns dimmed where unlit (weather.js CROWN_FRAG).\n85:- ac6d826e lit windows glowing in the rain (windowlight.js: view ray clipped to the light's\n87:- a82ee71b embers drifting off the fires (effects.js pa