{"parentUuid":"78e4af06-db79-4864-8eaf-d32cd1f10c3a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG84vs3MXCJMBB62yYsF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016eRdkbyRGo2vbVxL8jQ6Eg","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","old_string":"  meadow 15 -> 16 ms). The shafts (shafts.js) still use only the first light.\n","new_string":"  meadow 15 -> 16 ms). The shafts (shafts.js) still use only the first light.\n- 6bbd4fff old battle damage on the village walls (damage.js, new; main.js calls dressWalls(G,\n  built.props, LEVEL.lines) right after buildLevel; createDecals takes `pinned` room per kind and\n  gains pin() and the 'spall' plaster-break kind). Placement rasterizes each building side (model\n  space, front-most surface every 5 cm: depth, facing, atlas colour of the main prim), so marks\n  avoid windows/shutters/corners (step test 1.2 cm between cells, within 5 cm overall) and breaks\n  go only on /^house/ plaster (light, unsaturated, plain). Exposure: 5 rays of 12 m from just off\n  the model box's side at chest height (open ground) x how near the ground 8 m in front is to\n  LANE/STREET/TRACK. NOTE: the house fronts are mostly windows and open shutters, so most breaks\n  land on the gables; house_e's atlas already has one painted-in break on a gable. Costs ~130 ms\n  placement + ~60 ms painting the break texture at load; GPU within noise (0.1-0.4 ms in the square).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":897,"cache_read_input_tokens":433693,"output_tokens":616,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":897,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","ite