 ms). The shafts (shafts.js) still use only the first light.","+- 6bbd4fff old battle damage on the village walls (damage.js, new; main.js calls dressWalls(G,","+  built.props, LEVEL.lines) right after buildLevel; createDecals takes `pinned` room per kind and","+  gains pin() and the 'spall' plaster-break kind). Placement rasterizes each building side (model","+  space, front-most surface every 5 cm: depth, facing, atlas colour of the main prim), so marks","+  avoid windows/shutters/corners (step test 1.2 cm between cells, within 5 cm overall) and breaks","+  go only on /^house/ plaster (light, unsaturated, plain). Exposure: 5 rays of 12 m from just off","+  the model box's side at chest height (open ground) x how near the ground 8 m in front is to","+  LANE/STREET/TRACK. NOTE: the house fronts are mostly windows and open shutters, so most breaks","+  land on the gables; house_e's atlas already has one painted-in break on a gable. Costs ~130 ms","+  placement + ~60 ms painting the break texture at load; GPU within noise (0.1-0.4 ms in the square)."," "," Measured: the meadow grass costs ~5.8-9.5 ms on this headless GPU at high quality looking across"," the meadow (0.5 ms looking at the sky), and it scales with pixels (fragment-bound: shading the"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8f2d7903-7007-4099-942f-187449537664","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visib